00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.270
That's the Friday response.

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:53.250
So investors, okay, well,

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.510
banks are doing a little bit better.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.010
And remember this index you're seeing

